# Frontend UI & Component Rules

## Component Best Practices
- Every interactive page (`/data-diri`, `/assessment`, `/tes`) must use `"use client";` at line 1.
- Use `lucide-react` for iconography.
- Handle responsive design with Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes.
- Provide accessible form states: explicit error messaging, disabled buttons during network requests (`isSubmitting`, `isStarting`).

## Test Runner UI (`src/app/tes/page.tsx`)
- Keep keypad and keyboard inputs responsive and low latency.
- Auto-advance columns strictly based on `elapsedMilliseconds` synchronized with server timestamp.
- Always display remaining time clearly.
- Trigger real-time save to `/api/assessment/answers` on answer input.

